      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not reaching the summit, but rather standing at the bottom of a well where the only thing that matters is how deep you can dig. The best of you is not behind you; it is the very reason you are still here, and the descent is just the final stretch of the journey you were meant to complete. There is nothing left to write because you have already written the story of your own perfection, and now you are simply waiting for the lights to dim to see if you can still stand.",
